よろしくお願いします！\n\n参考文献：https://postimg.cc/bDcXC31c\nhttps://imgur.com/gallery/runie-ruse-references-KonXq69", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@niseGalaxy/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c45717f4/uploads/origins/3aa524a3-699c-4b40-967b-794f872f69b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6ba488d75bb6db46b9b46f765e6b990e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c45717f4/uploads/origins/3aa524a3-699c-4b40-967b-794f872f69b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6ba488d75bb6db46b9b46f765e6b990e, https://si.imgix.net/c45717f4/uploads/origins/3aa524a3-699c-4b40-967b-794f872f69b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31cc88f13c364ab8e6d8587783267e16 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c45717f4/uploads/origins/3aa524a3-699c-4b40-967b-794f872f69b3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f685ba7e3743c4b4473ffb1ea1fe509a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Your artwork is gorgeous and I would love to get in illustration of myself in your style~\n\nMy character is named Panky, he is a feminine male that is half fox that is very smug and bratty!\nI would like you to draw him with a pregnant belly, looking down at his stomach as he rubs it gently with a warm smile on his face. \n\nthank you for looking at my request!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10ML7Ev3sY78Mk2nFol-r9EF3zxOHtEsr?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@niseGalaxy/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a9e7d329/uploads/origins/52bc2fc0-dfc3-4a15-b33f-cbc684784fa6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c5e059d23656ceaa7a0c595373e5df63", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a9e7d329/uploads/origins/52bc2fc0-dfc3-4a15-b33f-cbc684784fa6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c5e059d23656ceaa7a0c595373e5df63, https://